    [*] --> pickFormat : New chat
    [*] --> opening : Open older project
    opening --> pickFormat : Format known, still a draft
    opening --> ready : Format known, video done
    opening --> slider : It is a slider post
    opening --> cantOpen : 5 tries in a row fail
    cantOpen --> opening : Tap Try again

    pickFormat --> loadingFormats : Formats not loaded yet
    loadingFormats --> pickFormat : Server lists formats
    loadingFormats --> formatsFailed : All retries fail
    formatsFailed --> loadingFormats : Tap Retry
    pickFormat --> savingFormat : Tap a format
    savingFormat --> addFootage : Saved (video formats)
    savingFormat --> slider : Saved (Slider)
    savingFormat --> pickFormat : Refused, reason shown

    addFootage --> pickFormat : Tap Change format
    addFootage --> uploading : Choose clips
    uploading --> addFootage : All clips attached
    uploading --> uploadFailed : Upload fails twice
    uploadFailed --> uploading : Tap Retry
    uploading --> uploadLimbo : App killed mid-retry
    uploadLimbo --> uploadFailed : iOS reports the cancel
    addFootage --> thinking : Send message or footage
    addFootage --> messageBounced : Project changed elsewhere
    messageBounced --> addFootage : Send again

    thinking --> preparing : Kria starts on the clips
    thinking --> direction : Kria proposes a plan
    thinking --> addFootage : Kria replies or reports an error
    preparing --> direction : Clips ready, plan proposed
    preparing --> prepFailed : Preparation fails
    prepFailed --> preparing : Tap Retry preparing clips

    direction --> rendering : You approve
    direction --> thinking : You ask for changes
    rendering --> ready : Video finished
    rendering --> failed : Render failed
    failed --> direction : Retry approved edit
    failed --> thinking : Tell Kria what to change
    ready --> thinking : Ask for another version
    ready --> direction : New plan proposed
    ready --> readyResolving : Opened before details load
    readyResolving --> ready : Project details arrive
    ready --> unknownStyle : Style not in iPhone's list
    ready --> [*]

